      equipment: 'Standard 52-card deck.',
      dealing: 'First dealer chosen at random; deal rotates clockwise. Number of cards per player varies by deal: starts at 1 card each for as many deals as players, increases by one per deal up to 8 each, then 8 each for as many deals as players, then decreases back to 1. Example with 4 players: 1,1,1,1, 2,3,4,5,6,7, 8,8,8,8, 7,6,5,4,3,2, 1,1,1,1 (24 deals). After the deal, the next card is turned for trump; in 8-card hands no card remains, so those hands are played without trumps.',
